   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "THE HOUSE IS BUILT AT RUNTIME.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 48
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a haunted house you\nrun through on live\ntelevision. The build says\nit isn't the same house\ntwice.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 6.054,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It ships a dungeon\ngenerator.",
   "start": 6.304,
   "duration": 1.874,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Haunted House Hellshift.\nYou collect eyeballs to\nopen cursed doors, and a\nstudio audience watches.",
   "start": 10.428,
   "duration": 6.628,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Two point one gigabytes,\nUnity on Mono. So every\npackage name is readable.",
   "start": 17.306,
   "duration": 5.218,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And in that list is DunGen\n— a procedural level\nbuilder. Rooms and rules\nin, a layout out, at\nruntime.",
   "start": 22.774,
   "duration": 6.759,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "So tonight's house isn't\nthe one you learned\nyesterday. A design\ndecision, read off a file\nlist.",
   "start": 29.783,
   "duration": 5.427,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
